---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Meal plan
permalink: /meal-plan/index.html
---
<section class="section page-intro" aria-labelledby="plan-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">A little planning goes a long way</p>
  <h1 id="plan-heading">Your meal plan.</h1>
  <p class="intro">A home for the recipes you want to cook. Your selections are saved in this browser when storage is available.</p>
  <noscript><p class="empty-state">Enable JavaScript to select recipes and view your saved meal plan. You can still <a href="{{ '/' | url }}">browse all recipes</a>.</p></noscript>
  <p data-plan-summary></p>
  <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/shopping-list/' | url }}">View shopping list <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  <div class="empty-state" data-plan-empty hidden>
    <p class="status-label">Something delicious starts with a plan</p>
    <p>Add recipes from the collection, then come back here to see your meals.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Back to recipes <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="recipe-grid" data-meal-plan hidden>
    {% set isMealPlan = true %}
    {% for recipe in recipes %}
      {% include "components/recipe-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
